<Slide style={{ background: "#0B1220", padding: "42px 72px 40px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3 }}>问题</Text>
  <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 12 }}>一个大脑包办所有事，代价落在三处</Text>
  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 28, marginTop: 38 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(239,68,68,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 26, height: 300 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#EF4444", fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>01</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, marginTop: 14 }}>判不准</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>同一个模型既要想「用户要什么」，又要想「这事能不能办」。两个目标写在一段提示词里，互相干扰，结果是该拦的没拦，该放的没放。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.08)", border: "1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 26, height: 300 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>02</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, marginTop: 14 }}>说不清</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>出错时只能看到一个结论，不知道是哪一步出的问题。评委问「为什么判黄」，答不上具体规则与阈值，等于没有判定。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(107,114,128,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(107,114,128,0.35)", borderRadius: 12, padding: 26, height: 300 }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: "Consolas, monospace" }}>03</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, marginTop: 14 }}>改不动</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>要加一条风控规则，得动主流程；要加一句合规校验，还得动主流程。改一处牵全身，团队里没人敢动那段代码。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, marginTop: 30, borderTop: "1px solid #243044", paddingTop: 22 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.4, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 600 }}>解法不是换更强的模型，是把一件事拆给多个专职角色</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>每个角色只回答自己那一个问题，模型只做理解与选择，判定逻辑留在代码里。</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 12 }}>三个代价对应三处改动：多视角交叉验证替代单点判断，规则命中留痕替代只给结论，角色隔离替代改主流程。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.07)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3)", borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 700 }}>三个代价怎么消</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 6 }}>判不准靠并行多视角交叉验证，说不清靠命中规则留痕，改不动靠角色隔离各自演进。</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8 }}>三组代价在同一套改动里一起消掉，不需要分批上线。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
